        <activityName xml:lang="en">Kraft paper, unbleached, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Kraft paper, unbleached, at plant
na;
Synonyms: packaging paper, Verpackungspapier, sack paper, Papiersack; 
UUID: 9026e9f3-88b3-307d-9b29-fe27eea7279c
This module includes the European production of unbleached kraft paper in an integrated mill - including transports to paper mill, wood handling, chemical pulping, paper production, energy production on-site and internal waste water treatment.; Geography: Data from one European producer and from a finnish database used as European average data.
Location: Data from one European producer and from a finnish database used as European average data.
Technology: Average of present used technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: Total European wrappings 2000: 3649 kt (CEPI statistics)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9026e9f3-88b3-307d-9b29-fe27eea7279c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
